# Payload-carrying states, mixed static and dynamic cells.
# The machine this fixture describes is the one in ARCHITECTURE.md.

machine Timer
initial Idle
states  Idle Running Done
actions Start Tick Cancel

Idle    | HANDLE                  | IGNORE | IGNORE
Running | IGNORE                  | HANDLE | GO(Idle, StopClock)
Done    | GO(Running, StartClock) | IGNORE | IGNORE
